                <div class="wiki-top"><div><span class="wiki-type" id="wiki-dynamic-type">技术方案 · IP-2026-0841</span><h1 id="wiki-dynamic-title">稀疏专家路由与动态负载均衡方法</h1><p id="wiki-dynamic-summary">面向大规模混合专家模型推理场景的动态路由与拥塞预测技术方案。</p></div><div class="wiki-actions"><button class="secondary-btn" id="wiki-edit" data-testid="wiki-edit">编辑 Wiki</button><button class="secondary-btn" id="wiki-version-history" data-testid="wiki-version-history">历史版本</button><button class="primary-btn" id="share-wiki">分享 Wiki</button></div></div>
                <div class="wiki-stats"><span><small>权属部门</small><strong id="wiki-owner">推理架构组</strong></span><span><small>版本</small><strong id="wiki-version">V1.3</strong></span><span><small>综合置信度</small><strong class="purple" id="wiki-confidence">98.6%</strong></span><span><small>证据覆盖</small><strong id="wiki-evidence-count">14 / 14</strong></span><span><small>密级</small><strong class="danger-text" id="wiki-sensitivity">机密</strong></span></div>
                <section id="wiki-overview" data-wiki-search-section><h2><span>01</span> 方案概览</h2><div class="insight-callout"><span>◆</span><p><strong>核心价值结论</strong><span id="wiki-executive-summary">通过实时负载向量预测与 Top‑K 专家集合动态调整，在不增加推理硬件的前提下，将 P99 延迟降低 31.6%，专家间负载方差降至 0.08。</span> <button class="citation" data-open-provenance data-evidence-id="DEMO-S-049-01" data-testid="wiki-citation">S-049-01 ↗</button></p></div><p id="wiki-overview-copy">该方案解决大规模混合专家模型在峰值负载下的专家节点冷热不均问题。系统在推理批次开始前预测拥塞概率，并根据预测结果对路由选择进行微调，从而避免热点专家排队。</p></section>
                <section id="wiki-mechanism" data-wiki-search-section><h2><span>02</span> 核心机制</h2><div class="mechanism-grid" id="wiki-mechanism-grid"><article><i>01</i><h3>负载向量采集</h3><p>以 200ms 窗口持续汇总各专家的 token 队列、显存占用与响应延迟。</p><button class="citation" data-open-provenance>S-047-06 ↗</button></article><article><i>02</i><h3>拥塞概率预测</h3><p>采用二阶指数平滑形成下一周期专家拥塞评分，消除瞬时尖峰干扰。</p><button class="citation" data-open-provenance>S-048-03 ↗</button></article><article><i>03</i><h3>动态路由决策</h3><p>在语义亲和度约束内重排 Top‑K 集合，并对高拥塞专家执行软降权。</p><button class="citation" data-open-provenance>S-048-09 ↗</button></article></div></section>
                <section id="wiki-metrics" data-wiki-search-section><h2><span>03</span> 验证指标</h2><div class="metric-evidence" id="wiki-metric-grid"><div><span>P99 推理延迟</span><strong>−31.6%</strong><small>2,140ms → 1,464ms</small></div><div><span>负载方差</span><strong>0.08</strong><small>基线 0.27</small></div><div><span>额外算力</span><strong>0</strong><small>相同 GPU 配置</small></div><div><span>吞吐提升</span><strong>+22.4%</strong><small>tokens / sec</small></div></div></section>
